    values:partOf concept:crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024-sch-1-sec-17a ;
    skos:note "A person who is 18 or over can opt out of being treated as a child complainant. A person over 18 can opt out of being treated as a child witness." ;
